### 1. No token: 401
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments

### 2. merchant-1 creates a shipment: 201, Location /v1/shipments/{id}
# @name create
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantReference": "ORDER-14002",
  "carrier": "FastShip",
  "trackingNumber": "FS1400002",
  "promisedBy": "2026-10-28T18:00:00+01:00"
}

### 3. merchant-1 reads it: 200, and no receivedAt anywhere
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### 4. merchant-2 asks for the same id: 404
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant2}}

### 5. A read-only token tries to create: 403
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{readonly1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantReference": "ORDER-2002",
  "carrier": "FastShip",
  "trackingNumber": "FS200002",
  "promisedBy": "2026-10-28T18:00:00+01:00"
}

### 6. A read-only token can read: 200
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-2001
Authorization: Bearer {{readonly1}}

### 7. A token without merchant_id: 403
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{nomerchant}}

### 8. A FastShip shipment the Gateway will follow
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantReference": "ORDER-3001",
  "carrier": "FastShip",
  "trackingNumber": "FS400001",
  "promisedBy": "2026-10-28T18:00:00+01:00"
}

### 9. A NordPost shipment
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantReference": "ORDER-3002",
  "carrier": "NordPost",
  "trackingNumber": "NP400001",
  "promisedBy": "2026-10-28T18:00:00+01:00"
}

### 10. Watch them fill in (send every 30 seconds or so)
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-3001
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### 11.
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-3002
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### 12. A FastShip shipment under chaos
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantReference": "ORDER-3003",
  "carrier": "FastShip",
  "trackingNumber": "FS400002",
  "promisedBy": "2026-10-28T18:00:00+01:00"
}

### 13. Watch it
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-3003
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Isolation 1: a FastShip shipment
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-7001", "carrier": "FastShip", "trackingNumber": "FS700001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Isolation 2: a NordPost shipment
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-7002", "carrier": "NordPost", "trackingNumber": "NP700001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Isolation 3: watch FastShip (should be Delivered after about 2 minutes, even with NordPost down)
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-7001
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Isolation 4: watch NordPost (stuck while it's down, catches up after the reset)
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-7002
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### ParcelGo: pushes instead of being polled
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-8001", "carrier": "ParcelGo", "trackingNumber": "PG800001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Watch it
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-8001
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Chaos run: FastShip
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-9001", "carrier": "FastShip", "trackingNumber": "FS900001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Chaos run: NordPost
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-9002", "carrier": "NordPost", "trackingNumber": "NP900001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Chaos run: ParcelGo
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-9003", "carrier": "ParcelGo", "trackingNumber": "PG900001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Chaos run: all three
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?status=Delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Chaos check: FastShip
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-9001
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Chaos check: NordPost
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-9002
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Chaos check: ParcelGo
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-9003
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Bus: FastShip
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-10001", "carrier": "FastShip", "trackingNumber": "FS1000001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Bus: NordPost
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-10002", "carrier": "NordPost", "trackingNumber": "NP1000001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Bus: ParcelGo
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-10003", "carrier": "ParcelGo", "trackingNumber": "PG1000001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Bus check: FastShip
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-10001
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Bus check: NordPost
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-10002
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Bus check: ParcelGo
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?reference=ORDER-10003
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Outbox test: a new FastShip shipment
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-11001", "carrier": "FastShip", "trackingNumber": "FS1100001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Webhook: merchant-2 registers (201, with the secret, once)
PUT {{publicapi}}/v1/webhook
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://localhost:7049/merchant-hooks/merchant-2" }

### Webhook: read it back (no secret this time)
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/webhook
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}

### Webhook: delivery log
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/webhook/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant2}}

### Webhook: a read-only token can't change it (403)
PUT {{publicapi}}/v1/webhook
Authorization: Bearer {{readonly1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://localhost:7049/merchant-hooks/merchant-1" }

### Final chaos: FastShip
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-13001", "carrier": "FastShip", "trackingNumber": "FS1300001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Final chaos: NordPost
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-13002", "carrier": "NordPost", "trackingNumber": "NP1300001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Final chaos: ParcelGo
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchantReference": "ORDER-13003", "carrier": "ParcelGo", "trackingNumber": "PG1300001", "promisedBy": "2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00" }

### Delivery log for merchant-1
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/webhook/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}